        `s 113.1(7)(a) and (b) — the rates for the year stand in the required relation` `the rate for employees for the year` `the rate for employers for the year` `the rate for self-employed persons for the year`
    AND `s 113.1(7)(c) — the rate for employees or employers is not increased by more than one-tenth of a percentage point` `the rate for employees for the year` `the rate for employees for the previous year`
    AND `s 113.1(7)(c) — the rate for employees or employers is not increased by more than one-tenth of a percentage point` `the rate for employers for the year` `the rate for employers for the previous year`
