    `s 114(4) — the consent of at least two thirds of the included provinces, having at least two thirds of their population, has been signified` `the number of included provinces` `the number of included provinces whose lieutenant governor in council has signified consent` `the population of all the included provinces` `the population of the included provinces that have signified consent`

-- "In the first review required by subsection (1) after 2027 and every third review that follows": the review of the three-year period that begins
