GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 113.1(13) — the Minister of Finance may recommend to the Governor in Council that the regulations made under subsection 46(7) be amended` `a review required by subsection 113.1(2) has been completed` MEANS
    `a review required by subsection 113.1(2) has been completed`

@ref Act s 113.1(13) (src:3006-3007)
GIVEN `the recommendations made under subsection 113.1(2) are that no changes be made to the adjustment factors` IS A BOOLEAN
